# Portfolio Intelligence Hub — Flagship Feature Redesign

## Overview

Transform the current chat-only AI analysis page into a **full-fledged Portfolio Intelligence Hub** — a data-rich dashboard that auto-generates a comprehensive portfolio health report on load, with a **Copilot-style AI chat bar** docked at the bottom for follow-up conversations. The AI has full context of the dashboard data and can render rich interactive widgets inline.

