### 3. Backend — Enhanced Chat Endpoint

#### [MODIFY] [portfolio.py](file:///c:/Stock%20AI%20tool/backend/app/routers/portfolio.py) — `POST /api/portfolio/chat`

Currently the chat only passes `symbol, name, sector, qty, avg_buy_price` to the LLM. Enhance it to pass **all** snapshot data (fundamentals, technicals, news, regime) so the AI can give truly informed answers.

- Accept an optional `snapshot_summary` field in the request body (pre-computed by the frontend) to avoid re-querying the DB
- The system prompt will include the full portfolio context with aggregated metrics

