### 4. Frontend — Dashboard-First Layout

#### [NEW] `/portfolio/analysis/page.tsx` (complete rewrite)

The page will have two main sections:

**A. Full-Width Data Dashboard (Top)**

Loads via a Server Action that calls `GET /api/portfolio/snapshot`. Renders:

| Section | Description | Visual |
|---|---|---|
| **Health Score Ring** | Large circular gauge (0-100) with color coding | Animated SVG donut |
| **Summary Cards** | Total Invested, Current Value, P&L, Holdings Count | Glass cards with gradients |
| **Regime Badge** | Bull/Bear/Sideways indicator with Nifty context | Colored pill badge |
| **AI Report Sections** | Collapsible accordion cards for each report section | Animated accordions |
| **Top Performers** | Top 5 gainers with sparkline mini-charts | Compact cards |
| **Bottom Performers** | Top 5 losers with sparkline mini-charts | Compact cards |
| **Risk Alerts** | Color-coded severity badges | Warning/danger badges |
| **Sector Donut** | Interactive sector allocation chart | Recharts PieChart |
| **Rebalancing Suggestions** | Action cards with Buy/Sell/Hold badges | Gradient action cards |

**B. Copilot-Style AI Chat Bar (Bottom-Docked)**

A sleek, collapsible chat bar that slides up from the bottom of the screen:

- **Collapsed state**: A slim bar showing "Ask about your portfolio..." with the AI icon — always visible
- **Expanded state**: Slides up to ~50% of screen height, showing the full chat history and input
- **Context-aware**: The AI already has the full snapshot data, so it can answer instantly about any stock, sector, or metric
- **Rich responses**: The AI can reference data from the dashboard and provide specific numbers

