## User Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant SA as Server Action
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant LLM as Cerebras LLM

    U->>FE: Navigate to /portfolio/analysis
    FE->>SA: fetchPortfolioSnapshot()
    SA->>BE: GET /api/portfolio/snapshot
    BE-->>SA: Full snapshot data (holdings, fundamentals, technicals, news, regime)
    SA-->>FE: Render dashboard instantly with real data
    
    Note over FE: Dashboard shows immediately with data cards, charts, metrics
    
    FE->>SA: generatePortfolioReport(snapshot)
    SA->>BE: POST /api/portfolio/report
    BE->>LLM: Generate structured health report
    LLM-->>BE: JSON report (health score, sections, risks, suggestions)
    BE-->>SA: Report data
    SA-->>FE: Render AI report sections with animations

    Note over FE: User sees health score gauge animate, report sections fade in

    U->>FE: Opens Copilot chat bar
    U->>FE: "Should I sell my banking stocks?"
    FE->>SA: sendPortfolioChatMessage(messages, snapshot_summary)
    SA->>BE: POST /api/portfolio/chat (with full context)
    BE->>LLM: Chat with portfolio context
    LLM-->>BE: Detailed analysis response
    BE-->>SA: Response
    SA-->>FE: Render in chat bar with rich formatting
```

