## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Stock-level deep dives**: When the user clicks on a specific stock in the dashboard, should it:
> - A) Open a modal/drawer with an AI-generated summary for that stock (uses an LLM call)
> - B) Navigate to the existing `/stocks/[ticker]` page
> - C) Both — show a quick AI summary in a popover, with a link to the full stock page

> [!NOTE]
> **Data freshness**: The portfolio snapshot will use whatever data is currently in the database (prices, fundamentals, technicals, news). If data is stale (e.g., last synced 2 days ago), the report will note this. We won't trigger live data fetches during analysis to keep the page fast.

